      <title>韩国电力公社要求三星与SK海力士支付25万亿韩元电费预付款</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260903/%E9%9F%A9%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B5%E5%8A%9B%E5%85%AC%E7%A4%BE%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F%E4%B8%8ESK%E6%B5%B7%E5%8A%9B%E5%A3%AB%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%9825%E4%B8%87%E4%BA%BF%E9%9F%A9%E5%85%83%E7%94%B5%E8%B4%B9%E9%A2%84%E4%BB%98%E6%AC%BE/</link>
